<view class="page cloud-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">CLOUD BASE</view>
  <view class="h1">云开发状态</view>
  <view class="muted subline">配置真实 AppID 和 envId 后，用这里检查云函数是否部署成功。</view>

  <view class="section status-grid">
    <view class="status-card">
      <view class="status-label">云开发开关</view>
      <view class="status-value">{{useCloud ? "已开启" : "未开启"}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="status-card">
      <view class="status-label">环境 ID</view>
      <view class="status-value small">{{envIdText}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="status-card">
      <view class="status-label">初始化</view>
      <view class="status-value">{{cloudReady ? "已初始化" : "未初始化"}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="status-card">
      <view class="status-label">AppID</view>
      <view class="status-value small">{{appidText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="ink-button section" loading="{{checking}}" bindtap="checkCloud">查看当前微信身份 / openid</button>
  <view class="section help-card">
    <view class="h2">店员微信提醒怎么开</view>
    <view class="muted">1. 用「要收通知的那台手机微信」打开本小程序。</view>
    <view class="muted">2. 点上面按钮，记下 openid（一串 o 开头的字符）。</view>
    <view class="muted">3. 在「我的」里点「接单提醒」并允许（授权后才能收到服务通知）。</view>
    <view class="muted">说明：openid 不是微信号，是「这个微信打开你们小程序」时的内部编号。</view>
  </view>
  <button class="light-button seed-button" loading="{{seeding}}" bindtap="seedDemoData">同步前台基础资料</button>
  <button class="light-button seed-button" loading="{{smoking}}" bindtap="runSmokeTest">运行云端写入检查</button>
  <button class="line-button seed-button" loading="{{cleaning}}" bindtap="cleanupSmokeData">清理自动检查记录</button>
  <button class="light-button seed-button" loading="{{cataloging}}" bindtap="checkCatalogCrud">检查商品/活动管理</button>

  <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="section result-card">
    <view class="result-title">{{result}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{openid}}" class="muted">openid：{{openid}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-text">{{error}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{seedResult}}" class="section result-card">
    <view class="result-title">基础资料同步结果</view>
    <view class="muted">{{seedResult}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{smokeResult}}" class="section result-card">
    <view class="result-title">云端写入检查结果</view>
    <view class="muted">{{smokeResult}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{cleanupResult}}" class="section result-card">
    <view class="result-title">自动检查记录清理</view>
    <view class="muted">{{cleanupResult}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{catalogResult}}" class="section result-card">
    <view class="result-title">商品/活动管理检查结果</view>
    <view class="muted">{{catalogResult}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section help-card">
    <view class="h2">排查顺序</view>
    <view class="muted">1. AppID 不能是 touristappid。</view>
    <view class="muted">2. envId 必须来自当前 AppID 的云开发环境。</view>
    <view class="muted">3. `getOpenId` 云函数需要先上传并部署。</view>
    <view class="muted">4. 基础资料同步、商品管理和云端写入检查需要全部云函数都已部署。</view>
    <view class="muted">5. 新建云环境后如果报 invalid scope，等待几分钟再试。</view>
  </view>
</view>
